The numbers is a list of 1, 2, 2, and 3.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The rising is 1, while the falling is 1.
For every spot from 1 to last.
The before is item (spot minus 1) of numbers.
The here is item spot of numbers.
If before is more than here, set rising to 0.
If before is less than here, set falling to 0.

If rising is 1 or falling is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
